{"version":1,"content":"<p>親綠台北市信民兩岸研究協會（信民協會）公布最新台北市長民調，民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋首度領先國民黨台北市長蔣萬安。</p><p>沈伯洋的支持度為50.3%，領先尋求連任的蔣萬安17個百分點。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.098116+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:27:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T19:37:36.668678+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684299+00:00","content_hash":"50f39183a2c1b4c3feea85bf8c51ab245637b80487363a72553405e3f20e3364","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}